+                * #228). This is the memory-transfer half of the VU0
+                * macro-mode datapath: the CO-format arithmetic ops
+                * (VADD/VSUB/VMUL/VMADD/VMADDA-broadcast-row/VOPMSUB/
+                * etc, all already implemented above under case 0x12)
